    <bf:summary>
      <bf:Summary>
	<rdfs:label>Alex had a bad day at school. Everything that could go wrong did! And now he cant sleep because he's so worried that tomorrow will be worse! What is they run out of red crayons or he drops his lunch int he dirt? What if, what if, what if! Can Alex go to sleep with the help of his mom?</rdfs:label>
      </bf:Summary>
    </bf:summary>
    <bf:intendedAudience>
      <bf:IntendedAudience>
	<rdfs:label>Ages 4-8.</rdfs:label>
      </bf:IntendedAudience>
    </bf:intendedAudience>
